{"kind":"html","caption":"用滑动窗口维护当前无重复字符的连续区间，右指针逐个读入字符。遇到窗口内已出现的字符时，左边界直接移到该字符上次位置的后一位，再更新当前长度与最大长度。动画使用示例 s = \"abcabcbb\"，最终得到最长长度 3。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>无重复字符的最长子串</title>\n<style>\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n  .app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}\n  .title{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n  .subtitle{font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d;line-height:1.45}\n  .mono,.metric strong,.formula{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n  .board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}\n  .panel{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px}\n  .string{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,38px);gap:4px;margin-top:6px}\n  .index{height:14px;color:#8d8d8d;font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;text-align:center}\n  .cell{height:48px;width:38px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;background:#2d2d30;transition:.35s}\n  .slot.in-window .cell{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n  .slot.current .cell{box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}\n  .slot.duplicate .cell{background:#5a3030;border-color:#f48771}\n  .pointers{height:20px;margin-top:4px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,38px);gap:4px}\n  .pointer{text-align:center;color:#3794ff;font-weight:700;font-size:10px;opacity:0}\n  .pointer.show{opacity:1}\n  .metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}\n  .metric{padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:4px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n  .metric strong{display:block;color:#3794ff;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}\n  .status{min-height:auto;line-height:1.45;font-size:12px}\n  .status b{color:#3794ff}\n  .formula{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2a2d2e;font-size:11px;color:#d4d4d4}\n  .seen{margin-top:6px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n  .tag{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n  .progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}\n  .progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff}\n  .note{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\">\n  <div>\n    <div class=\"title\">滑动窗口寻找最长无重复子串</div>\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">s = \"abcabcbb\"</span>。蓝色区域是当前窗口，红色字符表示触发了重复。</div>\n  </div>\n  <section class=\"board\">\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"string\" id=\"string\"></div>\n      <div class=\"pointers\" id=\"pointers\"></div>\n      <div class=\"metrics\">\n        <div class=\"metric\">当前长度<strong id=\"currentLen\">0</strong></div>\n        <div class=\"metric\">历史最大长度<strong id=\"bestLen\">0</strong></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div>\n      <div class=\"formula\" id=\"formula\"></div>\n      <div class=\"seen\" id=\"seen\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"progress\"><span id=\"progress\"></span></div>\n  <div class=\"note\">关键点：左边界只向右移动，因此每个字符最多被窗口加入和移出一次，整体时间复杂度为 <span class=\"mono\">O(n)</span>。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst chars=[...'abcabcbb'];\nconst steps=[\n {r:0,l:0,b:1,dup:false,last:{a:0},msg:'读入 a，窗口内没有重复字符。'},\n {r:1,l:0,b:2,dup:false,last:{a:0,b:1},msg:'读入 b，窗口扩展为 ab。'},\n {r:2,l:0,b:3,dup:false,last:{a:0,b:1,c:2},msg:'读入 c，窗口 abc 的长度达到 3。'},\n {r:3,l:1,b:3,dup:true,last:{a:3,b:1,c:2},msg:'再次遇到 a，它上次位于 0；左边界跳到 1。'},\n {r:4,l:2,b:3,dup:true,last:{a:3,b:4,c:2},msg:'再次遇到 b，它上次位于 1；左边界跳到 2。'},\n {r:5,l:3,b:3,dup:true,last:{a:3,b:4,c:5},msg:'再次遇到 c，它上次位于 2；左边界跳到 3。'},\n {r:6,l:5,b:3,dup:true,last:{a:3,b:6,c:5},msg:'遇到窗口内的 b；左边界从 3 跳到 5。'},\n {r:7,l:7,b:3,dup:true,last:{a:3,b:7,c:5},msg:'又遇到 b；左边界跳到 7，窗口只剩一个 b。'}\n];\nconst stringEl=document.getElementById('string');\nconst pointersEl=document.getElementById('pointers');\nchars.forEach((ch,i)=>{\n const slot=document.createElement('div'); slot.className='slot'; slot.innerHTML=`<div class=\"index\">${i}</div><div class=\"cell\">${ch}</div>`; stringEl.appendChild(slot);\n const p=document.createElement('div'); p.className='pointer'; pointersEl.appendChild(p);\n});\nlet step=0;\nfunction render(){\n const s=steps[step];\n [...stringEl.children].forEach((el,i)=>{\n   el.className='slot'+(i>=s.l&&i<=s.r?' in-window':'')+(i===s.r?' current':'')+(i===s.r&&s.dup?' duplicate':'');\n });\n [...pointersEl.children].forEach((el,i)=>{\n   const labels=[]; if(i===s.l)labels.push('L'); if(i===s.r)labels.push('R');\n   el.textContent=labels.join(' / '); el.className='pointer'+(labels.length?' show':'');\n });\n const len=s.r-s.l+1;\n document.getElementById('currentLen').textContent=len;\n document.getElementById('bestLen').textContent=s.b;\n document.getElementById('status').innerHTML=`第 <b>${s.r+1}</b> 步：${s.msg}<br>当前子串：<b class=\"mono\">${chars.slice(s.l,s.r+1).join('')}</b>`;\n document.getElementById('formula').innerHTML=s.dup?`L = max(L, 上次位置 + 1)<br>= <b>${s.l}</b>`:`长度 = R - L + 1 = <b>${len}</b>`;\n document.getElementById('seen').innerHTML=Object.entries(s.last).map(([k,v])=>`<span class=\"tag\">${k} → ${v}</span>`).join('');\n const bar=document.getElementById('progress'); bar.style.transition='none'; bar.style.width='0'; requestAnimationFrame(()=>{bar.style.transition='width 1.7s linear';bar.style.width='100%'});\n step=(step+1)%steps.length;\n}\nrender();\nsetInterval(render,2000);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
